{"unit_id":"bubbleptr__dsh-holdem#feature-1","repo":"bubbleptr/dsh-holdem","commit":"23c476efb0bd52e0472610942e248b7db12f3372","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-holdem 的功能「会话牌桌」：在 DSH 会话中间栏注册德州扑克页面，显示牌桌状态并支持玩家操作。打开该页面可开始牌局、查看公共牌与玩家筹码。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.cjs:1075","src/host.js:229"]}
{"unit_id":"bubbleptr__dsh-holdem#feature-2","repo":"bubbleptr/dsh-holdem","commit":"23c476efb0bd52e0472610942e248b7db12f3372","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-holdem 的功能「模型对局」：五个智能体轮流使用当前 DSH 模型选择合法动作；没有可用模型选择时，牌局改用启发式决策。模型通过 holdem_act 提交动作与中文桌边闲话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:34","src/host.js:638","src/host.js:648"]}
